    "No exact Dowtel WS4000/4100, Sejin NS1000, Synertek S500 row in78-table PDF or238-row workbook; LG SD210(S500) is not Synertek.",
    "Early OEM negatives do not establish that these devices predate GVM: actual Dowtel and Synertek build literals date2004.",
    "All Synertek EADS substrings are Headset. Games and uisgame.c are native software evidence only, without an independently extracted game.",
    "LP2400 contains Java and a lone gvm string in native code; insufficient attribution to Sinjisoft/GNEX.",
    "Raw SGS scans cover structural v1/2/4/36 plain/XOR-A5 only. No arbitrary packing or complete filesystem reconstruction is implied.",
    "SV400 source BIN offsets refer to the vendor container bytes, not physical device addresses. Its internal packing has not been fully decoded.",
    "SB260103940KB archive was listed but not downloaded; SV730 directory request timed out; do not count them as inspected firmware."
